# config.json — DELIBERATELY TRACKED (it is the drone registry: MAC/name/
# group/tags/mDNS). It is NOT gitignored so the fleet definition is versioned.
# SECRET-HANDLING RISK (F-09): config.json can also hold secrets —
# network.command_token / per-drone command_token (firmware command auth) and
# server.auth_token (client->server auth). DO NOT commit real secret values.
# Keep tokens null in the tracked file and supply real values out-of-band
# (a local-only override, environment, or an untracked deployment copy).
# save_config() chmod 0600s the file on write to limit on-disk exposure.
# config.local.json   # use for local-only secrets if you adopt an override file
config.local.json
